{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/23981-rest-in-peace-nelson-mandela","id":23981,"title":"Rest in Peace, Nelson Mandela","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-05T14:31:13-08:00","id":23981,"title":"Rest in Peace, Nelson Mandela","content":"<a href=\"http://variety.com/2013/film/news/nelson-mandela-dead-1200500796/\" target=\"_blank\">Civil rights warrior dead at 95.</a><br /> <br /> He was too good for this world anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T15:31:32-08:00","id":24018,"title":"","content":"Damn. One of the great figures of the 20th century gone. I remember last year, this one professor told us briefly about his time secretly working with Mandela's rebels, buying and smuggling them supplies and whatnot (might have been bomb-making stuff, which kind of detracts from the story, but anyway). It was one of the most enthralling things I'd heard in a long time. It's a shame to hear that he's passed beyond the world he improved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T16:13:04-08:00","id":24054,"title":"","content":"Let us have a moment of silence for the guy. Man was a truly great leader.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T16:24:47-08:00","id":24061,"title":"","content":"Was the body even cold before they printed this: <a href=\"http://www.theonion.com/articles/nelson-mandela-becomes-first-politician-to-be-miss,34755/\" target=\"_blank\">Nelson Mandela Becomes First Politician To Be Missed</a> <i><br /> <br /> Following the death of former South African president and civil rights leader Nelson Mandela today at the age of 95, sources confirmed that the revered humanitarian has become the first politician in recorded history to actually be missed. \u201cToday we lost not only an international hero and a symbol of the resilient human spirit, but also the very first political figure ever who people actively wish was still alive and affecting world affairs,\u201d said political historian Wallace M. Delaney of Columbia University, adding that Mandela will long be remembered for enduring 27 years in prison in the fight against apartheid, championing equality across the globe, and standing alone as the only world leader whose passing left the international community grief-stricken and feeling a palpable void in their lives. \u201cCertainly people have felt a sense of sorrow at the deaths of politicians in the past, but Nelson Mandela\u2019s death is the only one on record that people everywhere unanimously agree has left the world notably worse off. I miss him, we all miss him\u2014and that\u2019s entirely unprecedented in the world of politics.\u201d Delaney added that he could not predict who might be the second politician to be missed by humanity, but confirmed there were no viable candidates anywhere out there right now.</i><br /> --------------<br /> <br /> The truth can be very amusing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","user":"Shadowflame","date":". 12-05-2013, 08:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T16:30:08-08:00","id":24063,"title":"","content":"I heard it on BBC. That's a pity. It seems the old guard of African revolutionaries and freedom fighters are passing away before our eyes. I only wish they could have brought peace and prosperity to Africa before they left.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1449-zakariya-ali-sher","name":"Zakariya Ali Sher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T05:27:50-08:00","id":24308,"title":"","content":"First Doris Lessing and now Nelson Mandela. Winter of 2013 is turning out cruel. Rest in peace.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T06:32:42-08:00","id":24332,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/23981-rest-in-peace-nelson-mandela?p=24308#post24308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First Doris Lessing and now Nelson Mandela. Winter of 2013 is turning out cruel. Rest in peace.</div> </div> </div> </div>..and Paul Walker...makes the three.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T07:07:42-08:00","id":24342,"title":"","content":"In Memoriam to Mr. Mandela, aka Father Madiba:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Invictus</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Out of the night that covers me,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Black as the pit from pole to pole,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I thank whatever gods may be</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">For my unconquerable soul.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In the fell clutch of circumstance</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I have not winced nor cried aloud.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Under the bludgeonings of chance</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">My head is bloody, but unbowed.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Beyond this place of wrath and tears</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Looms but the Horror of the shade,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">And yet the menace of the years</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finds and shall find me unafraid.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">It matters not how strait the gate,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">How charged with punishments the scroll,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I am the master of my fate,</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#505050\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I am the captain of my soul.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":311,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","user":"JoeB","date":". 12-06-2013, 10:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T09:08:14-08:00","id":24387,"title":"","content":"Nice but...hmm...straight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T13:11:05-08:00","id":24587,"title":"","content":"He was a great man who did many great things, and said many great words. I hope his influence will long outlive him (and I am sure it will), and we continue to strive for the better world he dreamed of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T06:45:58-08:00","id":25072,"title":"","content":"Rest in Peace Nelson Mandela. I need to read a biography of him, does anyone have a suggestion, didn't he write an Autobiography? Its sad I wonder if he even got to see the new movie based on his life.<br /> <br /> But he lived a long and accomplished life.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Oh I guess Long Walk to Freedom was his Autobiography right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","user":"Eldagusto","date":".  Biography 12-07-2013, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T21:56:19-08:00","id":25599,"title":"","content":"Rest in Peace Nelson Mandela. Yes, Long Walk to Freedom is his autobiography.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/139